<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I will show an opening and let the four of them escape.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> will probably see me as if I were just playing around.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I am playing the part of a man who, feeling Droga's effects, has grown so elated that he acts this unhurried.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> cannot possibly want that.</STYLE>
