{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "SE" "0" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="2">―</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, what are you doing?</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Suddenly a familiar voice leapt into my ears.</STYLE>
