<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Why? Why can I hear a voice like this?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s voice should only reach the second and third generations.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I am a first generation, so there is no way I could hear </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s voice...</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">For just an instant, I glanced at the rock wall.</STYLE><PG>
