<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The seal stone had been moved!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Beyond it was Verde's mummy...!</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Unbelievable... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I had thought </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> still did not know where the mummy was.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But it had kept that mummy ready as its trump card.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Which means the mummy's spores are getting into my body right now, and... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I am becoming a fourth generation.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">That is why </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s voice reaches me.</STYLE><PG>
