{CHANGECG "000" "$000080" "NORMAL" "32!" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">―Now, hurry, or the spores will reach </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> too and make her a fourth generation.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Do it right away, or make </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> a fourth generation.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">You may choose whichever you like, you know?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Either way, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> is going to become a divine messenger as she is.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> becomes a fourth generation, and there'll be no need for me to persuade her at all.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="9">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, why don't you try telling everyone the truth, here and now?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Then I can hardly keep standing by and watching.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I'll kill every one of you here in 0.1 seconds.</STYLE><PG>
