{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\秘密基地地下5.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花かばう.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, get back! </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">He</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">'s after </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, it looks like!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s voice brought me back to myself.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Right. Do not give up over something like this!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Even if I am starting to become a fourth generation, it should still be days before I lose my reason as a human.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"Oh? </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">, you're going to fight me all by yourself?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">　The women of Arata really are brave. But I'm not here to play, okay?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">　Ah, but </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">'re not one of Arata's people, are you? Impressive. Is it to protect your </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">little sister</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Wh-what are you talking about...!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"Huh? Nobody's told you yet? </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">'s adopted. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">She's really a daughter of the Kogori family, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">'s real older sister."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"N-no way!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">By exposing a secret like this, I make them think I truly mean to kill the four of them, or capture them.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">How should I act next?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It would be best to attack once more and miss again.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">But I cannot go on missing twice, three times.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">To make this the last attack, I have to put myself in a state where I cannot attack.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Then... I will strike the ground with </STYLE><STYLE ID="14" RUBY="こんしん">all my strength</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and injure my own arm.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">That way it becomes hard for me to attack any further.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">They will have to escape in that opening.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">However elated Droga has made me, breaking my own arm myself takes considerable courage.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But as things stand, the settlement will only be destroyed.</STYLE><PG>
Mom<STYLE ID="1">, I will do what I can with everything I have.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I know full well this much will not even count as </STYLE><STYLE ID="15" RUBY="しょくざい">atonement</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I will not let it end like this!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Don't underestimate us humans, you </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">mushroom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">!</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"I-I don't care if </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">'s my sister, or who I am! I'm definitely gonna protect </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> and the others...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Ha-haa, what a scary face. Honestly, what an annoying brat!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,人物2" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
