{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">I raised my arm as high as it would go and brought the nata down with </STYLE><STYLE ID="14" RUBY="こんしん">all my strength</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> was a hair's breadth from the blade as I swung it down and struck the ground.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Either the nata would break, or my arm would―</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
