{PLAYSND "SE\down1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ倒れる切られる.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "C" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> aside, the one I could least afford to have die was </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Her</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> death would leave no living second generation.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Of course, if someone else is doused with my blood, or with any resident's, a second generation is made.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">But something as unnatural as dousing people in blood should be avoided as far as possible.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I tried to stop the nata as it came down, but even so the big blade went straight toward </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">This would not stop at a fatal wound...!</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Ghost.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="9">"Damn...! It's no good if </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> die!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But the feel of it just now...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Had she been carrying something hard inside the front of her clothes?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">With that much force, it would have been no surprise if her body had been split wide open.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\屋上ドア.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\秘密基地地下扉あく2.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">! Over here, quick!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"R-right!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">When I looked toward the voice, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> had gone through the door.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Having come this far, all I can do is go with the flow.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Rather than thinking, just buy time!</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"W-wait right there!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\鉄格子開閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\秘密基地地下5.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">While I put on a show of being rattled, the door was locked.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Damn! Why!? I had the key...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">　You little </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">brat</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">! You swapped them!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Just then,</STYLE><PG>
"Can you hear me, all of you!? It's all right now!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Mom<STYLE ID="1">'s voice.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It seemed the residents had all gone down.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Mom<STYLE ID="1"> had done what she had to, as well.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The rest is up to me...!</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"Wait right there! I'll smash this door down!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\剣衝突.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{QUAKE "000" "QUAKE" "1" "50" "50" "500" "30"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
