{QUAKE "000" "QUAKE" "1" "50" "50" "500" "30"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">I hacked at the door with the nata as if I had gone berserk.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Even with Droga, a nata cannot break a metal door that easily.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"Hey, I said stop! There's gonna be a cave-in!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Shut up, shut up, shut up!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\剣衝突.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{QUAKE "000" "QUAKE" "1" "50" "50" "500" "30"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
