{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "5000" "WAIT"}
{WAIT "5000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\木落下.gal" "NORMAL" "5" "100" "540" "1" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\爆発.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{QUAKESTOP "5000"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Something heavy came down on top of me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">What is this...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Could it be the cherry tree from the Niimura main house...?</STYLE><PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<STYLE ID="8">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Bro</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Was it echoing through the cave, or being whispered right in my ear―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">A voice that left me unable to tell even that.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But this voice...</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\絶対何か居る雰囲気のアレ.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "BGM" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\栄一郎白装束.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "11" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">"Honestly... you've really gone and done it."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Just as I thought, </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Eiichiro</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\SE\菌糸.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "1000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "111" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\菌糸動き.lcm" "REPEAT" "#1" "C" "540" "100" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n111\r\n4\r\n0\r\n8000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Hyphae stretched out from the tree like tentacles and pinned my arms and legs.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Droga should have boosted my strength, yet they did not budge.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"Ngh...! Damn! Stop it, </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Eiichiro</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">! Let go...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"So that's all you've got, </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Bro</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">Ah well, the plan to use a human as a spy didn't work out either."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\サクラ白装束.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "11" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Well, it can't be helped. Human hearts waver, after all. Now we'll just have to do it ourselves."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"That's right. Either way, it's better if the humans are gone from this settlement."</STYLE><PG>
{STOPSND "SE" "10000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="9">"Ngh...! Damn...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Now, </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Eiichiro</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, let's finish them all before the police come."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"S-stop it...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">No! I have to get everyone out of here right now!</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="16">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="17">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="16">, you carry </STYLE><STYLE ID="18">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="16">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="17">"Y-yes!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="16">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="19">Grandma</STYLE><STYLE ID="16">! Pull </STYLE><STYLE ID="20">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="16"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="18">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="16"> up! Hurry!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Meanwhile, voices like that echoed from over there.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"H-hey... </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">Wait... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">Wait...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Do not go! You have to get out of here, quickly...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I have to tell them to run, quickly...!</STYLE><PG>
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="21">"Daaamn!!! Wait...! Wait!!"</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I shouted as loud as I possibly could.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But everyone ignored my voice and went up to the surface.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"Wait... damn it..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"My, my, </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, betraying the wife you love?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Sh-shut up, you monster! The traitor is </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"How ridiculous... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">You knew I move only by the will of the </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goddess</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="8">"Before long, </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Bro</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">, your body will become the </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goddess</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">'s as a fourth generation. You can only talk like that for now."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Ngh...! What are you going to do...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"It's simple. We kill them all."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Then we catch </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">, and with you as a first generation, </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Bro</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">, we make the </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goddess</STYLE><STYLE ID="8"> a complete being―"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"Don't be absurd! Whatever happens, I will never become a divine messenger!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"My, my, how troublesome. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Then let's do this: if you become a divine messenger, </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, we'll spare everyone's lives."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"I won't be fooled by that anymore!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Bro</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">, you're not thinking straight. The divine messenger can be any one of the residents who used Droga, you know?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">　I think you'd better just do as we say."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"Nothing good ever came of doing what you two said!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">You were so happy to meet me after I died. Wasn't that a good thing?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Shut up!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Then everyone on the surface dies. Everyone dies because of you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Bro</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Trying to gouge my heart like that won't...!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="8">"You really are stupid, </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Bro</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">. The moment you kept quiet for 10 years, </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="8"> had a share of the responsibility too, you know?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"That's why I won't make any more mistakes!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Hmm... you're surprisingly stubborn today, </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Bro</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">And really killing everyone on the surface would be a hassle in its own way..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"But if you don't hurry, the police will come, you know? If this gets out..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="8">"No, wait. I have a good idea."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"What is it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Before long, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="8"> will come here again. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">Over the May holidays, or summer vacation."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"I see, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s bound to come too, isn't she?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"Wh-what are you saying...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Oh my, didn't you notice, </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> got </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s blood on her, you know?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"What!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"That's right. </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="8"> has now become a third generation. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">, once she has her first period, or if we make her bleed when she comes to Arata, will end up killing </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">, I'd say."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, let me tell you the Goddess's other wish. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">It's this: </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s erasure."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"What do you mean...!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"The </STYLE><STYLE ID="22">Goddess</STYLE><STYLE ID="8"> hates </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">. The </STYLE><STYLE ID="22">Goddess</STYLE><STYLE ID="8"> is the jealous kind."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">What on earth are they saying?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, what on earth could connect them...?</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="8">"Well, there's no need to rush to find a divine messenger. Given time, we can make one whenever we like. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">A dead human can stay a divine messenger for 20 years at most. So we just need to find one within the 8 years before my body gives out."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"It was only last night that this place and Motoki-cho were fully connected, after all. The real search for a divine messenger can wait."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Well, it's a good chance. Let's have </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="8"> suffer until the </STYLE><STYLE ID="22">Goddess</STYLE><STYLE ID="8"> is satisfied. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="8"> merely dying won't satisfy the </STYLE><STYLE ID="22">Goddess</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"The </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goddess</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">... you mean the girl who came here ages ago...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yes, it's true that she―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Itohime</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, too, counts as one of the goddesses. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">But </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Itohime</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, it seems, can't bear this situation any longer."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="8">"I checked all sorts of things with </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Itohime</STYLE><STYLE ID="8"> last night too, see... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">But it's no good after all. Even after 800 years, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Itohime</STYLE><STYLE ID="8"> is only a lowborn girl. We judged her unfit to be a goddess."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"So </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Itohime</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> doesn't matter anymore. From now on, the </STYLE><STYLE ID="22">new goddess</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> is our master. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Itohime</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, at most, we'll keep bound here so she can't leak anything."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"Wh... who on earth is it...? This </STYLE><STYLE ID="22">new goddess</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Huh? Have you really gone stupid, </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Bro</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">　I thought </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">'d figure it out right away. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">The </STYLE><STYLE ID="22">goddess</STYLE><STYLE ID="8"> with the blood of Arata and Motoki, you know?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"To grant the </STYLE><STYLE ID="22">Goddess</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s true wish, we can't kill the people on the surface right now."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="8">"Now, that's enough. Let's withdraw too. The </STYLE><STYLE ID="22">new goddess</STYLE><STYLE ID="8"> is tired."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"That's right. </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, once you've become a complete fourth generation, let's meet again. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Ah, but by the time </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'re a fourth generation, you'll be in a holding cell or a prison, I wonder?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Hahaha! That's right, this is goodbye forever, </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Bro</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">I'll say it just in case, okay? If you tell anyone about this, we really will kill everyone."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Goodbye, </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">. I love you."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2,111" "17" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">The two of them vanished, just like that.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Am I going to die like this, unable to do anything?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">No, far from dying, I will become a fourth generation, and like them, I too...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I have to get out of here fast and tell the truth...!</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYMOVIE "毒々しい霧.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "0" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n255\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n255\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, tell anyone, and everyone dies, you know?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Without warning, a voice like that rang in my head.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Are they still watching me?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">No, the two of them are gone.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">So this means... they are making me hear it, like that danger sense.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="8">"That's right, </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Bro</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">. All </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="8"> can do is stay silent forever."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Shut up... shut up...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I will not sink to being your servant like this!</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, I love you."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Bro</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">, I wanted to be like </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"We're family, aren't we?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"I can never measure up to you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Bro</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">So I'm going to find my own happiness, in my own way."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">The two voices, pounding and ringing.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Into my head alone, the voices of the two came flooding in.</STYLE><PG>
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="21">"Shut up, </STYLE><STYLE ID="23">Eiichiro</STYLE><STYLE ID="21">!</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="21">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="24">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="21">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="24">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="21">'re a traitor!"</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "0"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "500" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "111" "$FFFFFF" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\真実.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家居間.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\サクラ\サクラ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "111" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Here, </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, hold her. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="25">Our child</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, she does take after </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> somewhere, after all."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Haha, it'd be a problem if she took after me. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">If she took after me, </STYLE><STYLE ID="25">this kid</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> would surely resent me."</STYLE><PG>
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<STYLE ID="1">What was that just now...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">That was... what I said when </STYLE><STYLE ID="25">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> was born.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家居間.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\サクラ\サクラ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\茅萱子供バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "14" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="25">"Mm... Does </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">this one</STYLE><STYLE ID="25"> take after </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="25"> too, I wonder?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hmm... I'd like her to take after her </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> too."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Hey, hey, give me a break. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="25">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">, if </STYLE><STYLE ID="25">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> took after me, you'd hate it, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="25">"Mm... I wouldn't mind taking after </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="25"> or </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="25">."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"Really? Then if </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">this kid</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> takes after me, you'd be glad?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="25">"Mm... Um... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="25">I'd rather she took after </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="25"> after all."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="25">Why, you</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">..."</STYLE><PG>
{DELETECG "000,人物1,人物2" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<STYLE ID="1">That was what the three of us talked about the day </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> was born.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Memories from when I was happiest, and voices, came back to life one after another.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Is this </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> making me hear them?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Or...</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">As I gave myself over to those voices, someone was feeling around my body.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Several people were surrounding me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">And my body was freed from the crushing weight of the cherry tree.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It seemed people from outside were rescuing me.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家居間.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "14" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"<STYLE ID="9">Kotaro</STYLE>, <STYLE ID="8">Eiichiro</STYLE>'s... 
{PAUSE ""}
dead, they say."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Huh!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"An accident. We're going to Motoki-cho right away."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"How could that happen...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"He fell from a tree and died, they said..."<PG>
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<STYLE ID="1">The start of a chain, starting without warning.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Yes. From that moment, the takeover of this Arata settlement began.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\サクラ死体首なし.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "14" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">... why..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">Eiichiro</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> had been dead 2 years when, this time, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> died.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">From her body, crushed in the fall, the head had been cut off.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> had killed herself, and someone had cut off her head.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">A year after that―</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "環境音\アポカリプティック.ogg" "SE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">That eerie sound rang out―</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\サクラ白装束.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Before me, once again, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> appeared.</STYLE><PG>
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\秘密基地奥セピア.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">"If I come here, can I see </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> again?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Mm-hm. Whenever you call me, </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Hm?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"I'm glad I married you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> and our two daughters blessed me, and I was truly happy. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">No, I'm happy now, too. I died, but like this, with you again, </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><PG>
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="1"><TXSPS>Damn it damn it damn it damn it damn it damn it!</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
