{CHANGECG "000" "$000080" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9"><TXSPN>"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">! You betrayed me!? I did it for </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">, all this time, all of it for </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">　Damn it! You monsters! You'll remember this! Remember it!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Despairing at the happy scenes flashing back to me―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">and screaming until I did not even know what I was saying―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I was pulled out and taken away just as I was.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">While I still have my reason―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">before I rot away as a fourth generation―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I will have my revenge on them, without fail...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Remember this! You monsters...!</STYLE>
